# Defense-in-depth: the injection test (TestShippedTemplatesInputInjectionInert
# in configs_test.go) feeds shell-metacharacter payloads to the shipped bash
# templates. The payloads are inert (never executed), but a regression that
# lets the script's relative `mkdir -p` escape its t.TempDir() would create
# literal directories named with the payloads under this package. The test
# asserts no such leak occurs; these patterns are a backstop so any stray
# artifact can never be `git add`ed by accident.
$(touch *
`touch *
x; touch *
y && touch *
